<mxCell id="metric-3-title" value="D. Critical clinical error gate" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=23;fontColor=#17324d;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="metric-3"><mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="710" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="metric-3-body" value="ZERO observed critical released-data errors
One-sided 95% error upper bound &lt;= 0.001
At least 2,995 audited releases if zero errors
IDs, drug / dose / unit, order / result semantics
Assess automatic and human paths separately" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#17324d;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="metric-3"><mxGeometry x="20" y="70" width="705" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="metric-4" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#087f8c;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="585" width="745" height="295" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
