<mxCell id="metric-5-title" value="F. Fail-closed invariants" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=23;fontColor=#17324d;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="metric-5"><mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="710" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="metric-5-body" value="100% negative test cases block completion
Missing / &lt;0.80 fields never auto-release
Unknown type / failed HL7 never completes
Human approval cannot bypass HL7 checks
ZERO unauthorized or duplicate releases" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#17324d;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="metric-5"><mxGeometry x="20" y="70" width="705" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
