<mxCell id="metric-7-body" value="&gt;= 99.9% eligible jobs complete within 15 min
From upload, or human approval for review path
All output hashes + manifest reconcile: 100%
Fault / restart / duplicate / timeout test loss: 0
Required HL7 failures remain in denominator" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#17324d;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="metric-7"><mxGeometry x="20" y="70" width="705" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="metric-8" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#087f8c;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1615" y="930" width="745" height="295" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="metric-8-title" value="I. Latency / review operations" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=23;fontColor=#17324d;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="metric-8"><mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="710" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="metric-8-body" value="Automatic completion latency: p95 &lt;= 5 min
Measured at agreed peak load; errors count
&gt;= 95% review cases resolved within 1 workday
Report queue age, unresolved cases and N/A rate
Human wait is separate from compute latency" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#17324d;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="metric-8"><mxGeometry x="20" y="70" width="705" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="metric-9" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#087f8c;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="65" y="1275" width="745" height="295" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="metric-9-title" value="J. Automation / rejection burden" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=23;fontColor=#17324d;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="metric-9"><mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="710" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="metric-9-body" value="Proposed straight-through release rate &gt;= 70%
Denominator: all valid supported input faxes
Report by type / source, include rejected reads
Never lower 80% or safety gates to hit yield
Capacity-plan the remaining review workload" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#17324d;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="metric-9"><mxGeometry x="20" y="70" width="705" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
