<mxCell id="metric-10-title" value="K. Evidence and drift" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=23;fontColor=#17324d;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="metric-10"><mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="710" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="metric-10-body" value="&gt;= 30-day pilot at agreed peak load
Confidence bounds, counts and versions recorded
Critical error: immediately hold affected releases
Any gate miss / weak evidence: not qualified
Requalify model, schema and mapping changes" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#17324d;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="metric-10"><mxGeometry x="20" y="70" width="705" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="metric-11" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#087f8c;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1615" y="1275" width="745" height="295" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="metric-11-title" value="L. Final release decision" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=23;fontColor=#17324d;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="metric-11"><mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="710" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="metric-11-body" value="Clinical + data + interface + operations sign-off
ALL mandatory criteria pass; no weighted average
Unmeasured target is NOT an achieved result
Docs define denominators and statistical tests
Blob completion is NOT receiver ACK / acceptance" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#17324d;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="metric-11"><mxGeometry x="20" y="70" width="705" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="matrix-note" value="Accuracy is checked against independent ground truth, not the model confidence score. The fixed 0.80 gate alone does not prove correctness.
Targets are proposed for owner approval. Confidence intervals apply to rates, not F1; see ../docs/success-criteria.md for sampling and formulas.
Critical-error bound with zero errors: U95 = 1 - 0.05^(1/n). Do not claim a per-type/source result from a pooled sample.
Current package has no dedicated type classifier, HL7 transform or human-release API. These target stages need implementation and validation." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;fontColor=#63758a;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="65" y="1695" width="2240" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
